dialect plain
accent light broad
tier standard
written_for rmx_tilde_slagwell
written_by codex
title the promised portion
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=none
traits temper=even talk=plain warmth=warm humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=ambitious
quirk sets_a_jar_aside_before_counting_the_larder
likes warm_bread long_walks full_larder first_snow
dislikes cold_tea salt_wind
fears a_winter_shelf_full_of_empty_promises
